    "text": "By KBUN Sports ,\n8 hours ago Bemidji football used big plays and special teams to jump to a 35-0 lead on the way to a convincing 42-19 defeat of Sartell on Friday evening at Chet Anderson Stadium. The win ensures that the Lumberjacks will be the #2 seed for the Section 8 playoffs and will host Sartell for a semifinal game on Oct. 25. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
